WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Data import: the results folder
is dragged and dropped into the app.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
Results tab: impact indicators (EF v3.1)
for three battery scenarios: small, medium, large.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
The parameters of each scenario,
grouped by activity.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.500
Total Scores tab: pick the functional unit,
the scenarios and the indicators.

00:15.500 --> 00:20.500
Gather mode: the three scenarios as grouped bars.
A second indicator is added.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.000
Split mode: one chart per indicator.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Processes tab: the contribution of each process,
as stacked bars.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.000
Set the maximum number of flows and the cut-off,
then split the indicators.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
Upstream tab: the upstream supply chain
as a sunburst chart.

00:36.000 --> 00:39.000
A click zooms into one link of the chain;
hovering shows its value and share of the total.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Substances tab: the contribution of each substance,
including fossil carbon dioxide.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Hovering over a bar shows its score.

00:48.000 --> 00:50.000
Split mode: one chart per indicator.

00:50.000 --> 00:53.800
Re-import data returns to the import screen:
drop a results folder there.
